        <mxCell id="n2" value="Each direction only copies rows with _origin = source site and _ingested newer than the watermark stored on the target.&lt;br&gt;Copied rows keep their _origin, so they are never copied back (no loop).&lt;br&gt;Re-runs / overlapping windows are safe: ReplacingMergeTree dedups on (event_time, id)." style="shape=note;size=14;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
